px; margin-top: var(--e-global-size-6); margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px;\">– Mạng 100k/ phòng&nbsp;</p><p style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-top: var(--e-global-size-6); margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px;\">– Vệ sinh 100k/ phòng&nbsp;</p><p style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-top: var(--e-global-size-6); margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;\">– Điện chung 50k/ người( điện hành lang, thang máy, nhà xe)</p><h3 class=\"listivo-listing-simple-label\" style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Tiện nghi</h3><ul><li style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Hạn chế với người đi ô tô</li><li style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Nhà gần đường lớn</li><li style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Bàn bếp<br></li><li style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Ban công<br></li><li style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Điều hòa<br></li><li style=\"outline: none; border: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--e-global-size-4); margin-left: 0px; line-height: var(--e-global-typography-lheading3-line-height);\">Giường<br></li><li style=\"outline: none; borde